+      FIELD(rgba, "颜色 (rgba)\n\n颜色与透明度。只要与内部默认值不同，就会覆盖对应材质里的同名属性。\n\n官方原文：Color and transparency. If this value is different from the internal default, it overrides the corresponding material properties.");
+      FIELD(material, "材质 (material)\n\n渲染该元素时使用的材质。\n\n官方原文：If specified, this attribute applies a material to the skin.");
+      FIELD(young, "杨氏模量 (young)\n\n杨氏模量，衡量材料抗拉伸／抗压缩的刚度。单位是压强（力/面积）。\n\n官方原文：Young's elastic modulus, a measure of tensile and compressive stiffness for continuum elastic materials. Units of pressure = force/area.");
+      FIELD(poisson, "泊松比 (poisson)\n\n泊松比 —— 横向形变与纵向应变之比，无量纲，取值范围 [0, 0.5)。值小偏可压缩，值大偏不可压缩。\n\n官方原文：Poisson's ratio, the ratio of transverse deformation to applied longitudinal strain. This unitless quantity is in the range [0, 0.5).");
+      FIELD(damping, "阻尼 (damping)\n\n瑞利阻尼，作用于柔性体的所有边。\n\n官方原文：Damping of all edges.");
+      FIELD(thickness, "厚度 (thickness)\n\n壳厚度（长度单位），只对二维柔性体有效，用来缩放拉伸刚度。可以设成半径的两倍以贴合几何形状，但单独暴露出来是因为半径可能受碰撞检测的限制。\n\n官方原文：Shell thickness, units of length; only for used 2D flexes. Used to scale the stretching stiffness. This thickness can be set equal to 2 times the radius in order to match the geometry, but is exposed separately since the radius might be constrained by considerations related to collision detection.");
