+      FIELD(type, "类型 (type)\n\n纹理的表示方式与映射方式，也决定后面哪些属性有意义。cube 会把纹理立方体「热缩」包到物体上（除 material 的 texuniform 可微调外，过程全自动）；2d 是平面贴图；skybox 用作背景。\n\n官方原文：This attribute determines how the texture is represented and mapped to objects. It also determines which of the remaining attributes are relevant. The cube type has the effect of shrink-wrapping a texture cube over an object. Apart from the adjustment provided by the texuniform attribute of material, the process is automatic.");
