+      FIELD(mark, "标记 (mark)\n\n程序化纹理在 builtin 配色之上再加的标记：edge = 图像四周描边，cross = 正中画十字，random = 随机点亮像素。所有标记都是一个像素宽，所以纹理越小标记越显眼、越糊。\n\n官方原文：Procedural textures can be marked with the markrgb color, on top of the colors determined by the builtin type. \"edge\" means that the edges of all texture images are marked. \"cross\" means that a cross is marked in the middle of each image. \"random\" means that randomly chosen pixels are marked. All markings are one-pixel wide.");
+      FIELD(rgb1, "颜色 1 (rgb1)\n\n程序化纹理用的第一个颜色。加载立方体/天空盒贴图时，缺失的面也用这个颜色填充。各分量取值范围 [0, 1]。\n\n官方原文：The first color used for procedural texture generation. This color is also used to fill missing sides of cube and skybox textures loaded from files. The components of this and all other RGB(A) vectors should be in the range [0 1].");
+      FIELD(rgb2, "颜色 2 (rgb2)\n\n程序化纹理用的第二个颜色。\n\n官方原文：The second color used for procedural texture generation.");
+      FIELD(markrgb, "标记颜色 (markrgb)\n\n程序化纹理上标记点使用的颜色。\n\n官方原文：The color used for procedural texture markings.");
+      FIELD(random, "随机种子 (random)\n\n当 mark 设为 random 时，每个像素被点亮的概率。纹理越大像素越多，而这个概率是逐像素独立作用的 —— 所以纹理尺寸和概率要一起调。配上渐变天空盒可以做出星空效果。\n\n官方原文：When the mark attribute is set to \"random\", this attribute determines the probability of turning on each pixel. Note that larger textures have more pixels, and the probability here is applied independently to each pixel -- thus the texture size and probability need to be adjusted jointly.");
